   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Perhaps try the <font face=\"monospace, monospace\"><a href=\"http://as.is\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://as.is&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466261833000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3ZBF60LFFAkSLfEn54bs73\">as.is</a>=TRUE</font> flag? Seems to work for me if you include that (and exclude the <font face=\"monospace, monospace\">na.strings</font> flag):<div><br></div><div><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">r &lt;- read.csv(&quot;~/Downloads/data.csv&quot;, stringsAsFactors=FALSE, encoding=&quot;UTF8&quot;, <a href=\"http://as.is\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://as.is&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466261833000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3ZBF60LFFAkSLfEn54bs73\">as.is</a> = T)</font></div><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">adios,</font></div><div><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Ryan</font></div><div><br></div></div></div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
    ],
    [
