ULL from read.csv, but then it breaks a different part of the code where I need a blank to not be converted to NA. In short, something weird is going on that I can&#39;t figure out.</div><div><br></div><div>Example code/data attached.</div><div><br clear=\"all\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\">Thanks,<br>Erica<br><br>--<br>Erica Rettig<br>Ph.D. Candidate<br>Graduate Group in Ecology, UC Davis</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><br></div></div></blockquote></div></div></div>"
